BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Odd Couple
DTSTART:20270304T003000Z
DTEND:20270304T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T003714Z
UID:42473
DESCRIPTION:<p>Three comedic icons. Two best friends. One very stressful a
 partment.<br /><br />Steve Carell and John C. Reilly return to Broadway to
  star as Felix Ungar and Oscar Madison in a new production of Neil Simon&r
 squo\;s <em>The Odd Couple</em>\, directed by Tony Award winner Thomas Kai
 l (Hamilton). On Broadway for a 15-week limited engagement.</p>
LOCATION:Stephen Sondheim Theatre\, 124 West 43 Street\, New York NY 10036
 
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/The-Odd-Couple-Tickets
END:VEVENT
